{"id":"vod_bf_15232","vodId":"15232","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"舰队收藏","name_cn":"舰队收藏","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/37885750122f08f1ed75b53d382bd871.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在虚构的未来世界，彼时，人类因为疏忽和大意而失去了制海权，海洋，成为了人们可望而不可即的所在，盘踞在那里的，是一股名为“深海栖舰”的强大势力。为了同这股势力抗争，一群名为“舰娘”的女孩子们出现了，在她们的体内，栖息着舰艇之魂，亦是明日呢化身成为各式各样的战舰，为了人类的和平做着不懈的努力。　　平日里，舰娘们在名为“镇守府”的大本营里进行日常生活和训练，某日，一位名叫吹雪（上坂堇 配音）的活泼女孩出现在了大家的面前，初来乍到的她踌躇满志，热情满满地加入了舰队的新生活中去，在这里，充满了精彩和刺激的日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:00:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jianduishoucang/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:36.645Z"}